# Scrolling receipt for the Device Receipts pane. The host offers far more
# cards than fit, so this proves the ones past the fold are now reachable —
# and that the auto-hiding overlay bar appears while scrolling.
settle 30
key escape
act Open Device Receipts pane
settle 90
capture 01_top
# Wheel down inside the pane. The bar should be visible in this capture,
# taken immediately after, and gone by the last one.
scroll 770 400 600
capture 02_scrolled_bar_visible
scroll 770 400 600
capture 03_scrolled_more
# Past the hold+fade window: the bar auto-hides rather than sitting there.
settle 240
capture 04_bar_faded
